  "subtitle": "Pan-fried halloumi in rich tomato butter sauce",
  "excerpt": "Cubes of golden halloumi sit in a velvety tomato sauce enriched with butter and cream. This is a fast weeknight version of the classic Indian dish, using halloumi in place of paneer. The sauce comes together in about 30 minutes.",
